DirectorSKILL — director style module format
https://github.com/wangzhang-wu/DirectorSKILL
License: MIT

The director lens cards under assets/canvas-director/lenses/ follow the
section structure, the thirteen-key style-parameter block and the prompt
template layout of that project's reference modules. Text has been adapted
and extended for this plugin: slices are marked for selective injection, a
Chinese brief and a worked example were added per lens, and the parameter
blocks were mapped onto this plugin's four-layer model.

